    <string name="onboardingSoundsDesc">Immerse yourself in high-fidelity ambient resonance designed to synchronize your neural frequency.</string>
    <string name="onboardingSlide2Feature">Therapeutic Chimes &amp; Gemini AI</string>
    <string name="onboardingSlide2FeatureDesc">Soothe your entry and exit with authentic singing bowls, gongs, or let Gemini analyze your session history to recommend the optimal chime.</string>
